     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Measurement data and data management are essential for tool manufacturers and grinding companies in order to achieve high efficiency and documented quality. ZOLLER has everything you need for this. </strong></p> <p>With ZOLLER you have interfaces to CAD programs and CNC controls, hardware and software for the management of grinding wheels, measuring and testing devices for inspections that can be used close to the process and are accurate to the µm, as well as secure technologies for the error-free transfer of grinding wheel and geometry data to CNC grinding machines.</p>",
      "images": [],
